  "description": "Brilliant in both looks and talent, Ryu Chan-Yeong is an elite violinist admired by everyone around him. For Joo Ha-Jin, he is not just a role model but the person he dreams of standing beside on stage one day. That dream feels painfully distant until Ha-Jin is suddenly given a rare chance to receive private mentoring from Chan-Yeong himself. But fate takes a strange turn when Ha-Jin accidentally overhears something he was never meant to hear. Before he can even process it, Chan-Yeong confronts him with a shocking proposal. For a limited time, they will become intimate partners, and when Chan-Yeong decides it is over, it will end cleanly. In exchange, Ha-Jin will receive the mentorship he has longed for. \n\nCaught between ambition, desire, and the dangerous pull of the man he admires, Ha-Jin must decide how much he is willing to risk for his dream.\n\n(Source: Lezhin US)",
